    "id": "241",
    "question": "Assalamu Alaikum. I am a fan of Assunah Trust Dr. Abdullah Jahangir Sir. I have a question to Sir regarding Witr Salah. I offer 3 rakah Witr Salah (two rakahs at a time 1 rakah seperately). Can I offer 2 rakahs of Witr Salah in mosque half an hour later 1 rakah at home?",
