    "question": "Assalamu Alaikum, Amar Islami Bank Bangladesh Limited (IBBL) e akti sonchoyi account ache. Amar proshno hosse, jomakrito taka theke je interest asbe ta grohon boidho hobe kina? Tara (IBBL) dabi kore je tara islami shariah maintain kore.",
